 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Simmer the dashi, soy sauce and mirin for 1 minute, then set aside as a dipping sauce (tentsuyu).</li><li>Thaw frozen shrimp in the fridge first. Peel, keeping the tail fan, and remove the dark vein. Trim the sharp tail tips and scrape out trapped water; pat dry.</li><li>Make <b>3 shallow cuts across the belly</b>, then gently press the prawn straighter. Do not cut through or tear the flesh. Keep chilled while the oil heats.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
