     "name_html": "Mirin (dipping sauce)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the cold water and beaten egg first. Add the flour and cornstarch; stir briefly with chopsticks, leaving small lumps. Keep the bowl over ice. Make the batter only when the oil is ready.</li><li>Heat the oil to <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"175\" data-b=\"180\" data-s=\"0\">175–180 °C</span></b>. Dust two or three dry shrimp lightly with flour, shake off excess, then dip in batter. Let excess drip; the tail can stay bare.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
