    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lower two or three shrimp into the oil away from you.</li><li>Fry about <b>3–4 minutes</b>, turning once, until the coating is pale gold and crisp.</li><li>The thickest shrimp must be opaque and pearly through the centre; a probe should read <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"63\" data-s=\"0\">63 °C</span></b>.</li><li>Let the oil recover between batches and skim loose crumbs.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
