   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drain briefly on a rack without piling up.</li><li>Serve immediately with the dipping sauce, optional grated daikon and lemon.</li><li>The shrimp should stay juicy inside its thin crisp shell of batter.</li></ul>",
